          }
        }
      }
    },
    "内置 Agent 只能按目录预置的流程安装、升级和卸载；自定义 Agent 由本机手动登记的启动命令组成。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Built-in agents can only be installed, upgraded and uninstalled through the preset catalog flows; custom agents are launch commands you register on this machine."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
